karaoke,It's always,Comment: 0,0:00:41.68,0:00:46.08,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Someday, the dream that's covered in cuts and bruisesComment: 0,0:00:46.09,0:00:51.37,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,will become your one and only treasureComment: 0,0:00:51.38,0:00:55.02,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Magical excitement connects friendsComment: 0,0:00:55.03,0:00:58.01,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Living your life to the fullestComment: 0,0:00:58.01,0:01:00.76,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Shall we call it an adventure?Comment: 0,0:01:03.19,0:01:06.20,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Believing in a great dream togetherComment: 0,0:01:06.20,0:01:08.85,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,The bond with your rivalComment: 0,0:01:08.85,0:01:11.64,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Even failure is strangely charmingDialogue: 0,0:01:39.28,0:01:41.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.28,0:01:46.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Candy, candy... sluggie-gie!Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.32,0:01:46.26,Title,,0,0,250,,Wave RoomDialogue: 0,0:02:04.71,0:02:09.14,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you mean you're done for?! What's happening over there?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.14,0:02:11.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys!Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.07,0:02:13.67,Main,,0,0,0,,If we get caught in that wave, we'll be done for!Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.67,0:02:16.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh right! We have the Coup de Burst!Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.51,0:02:21.49,Main,,0,0,0,,We can't use it! We don't have enough cola!Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.49,0:02:25.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Pedro, I'm sorry! You sacrificed yourself to save us, but...Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.39,0:02:44.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone, listen!Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.10,0:02:49.85,Main,,0,0,0,,My cake!Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.28,0:02:57.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait! Wait, wait!Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.52,0:03:00.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.23,0:03:03.71,Main,,0,0,0,,If you do that, the cake will sink into the sea, too!Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.71,0:03:06.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.09,0:03:06.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.85,0:03:07.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.96,0:03:15.26,Main,,0,0,0,,D-Does this look okay, Jinbe-san?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.28,0:03:18.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's fine!Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.20,0:03:23.06,Main,,0,0,0,,But it's too reckless! You're trying to handle a ship's sails all on your own!Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.22,0:03:28.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami! How is the wind?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.86,0:03:32.74,Main,,0,0,0,,A strong wind is coming from the south!Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.23,0:03:34.84,Main,,0,0,0,,All right!Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.84,0:03:37.07,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do, Jinbe?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.53,0:03:46.10,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna tack this ship as fast as I can!Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.10,0:03:47.60,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.60,0:03:50.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you joking?! Why do you want to turn the ship?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.54,0:03:54.27,Main,,0,0,0,,We're going to enter the Green Room!Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.27,0:03:57.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Here we go! Here we go!Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.19,0:04:18.87,Main,,0,0,0,,The Green Room?! What's that?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.87,0:04:22.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are we heading towards the wave, Jinbe?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.22,0:04:29.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I see! This Green Room you're talking about must be Heaven!Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.96,0:04:34.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Doctor! I'll be heading over to your side soon!Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.28,0:04:40.30,Main,,0,0,0,,It's over! This is impossible! We aren't surfing, you know!Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.57,0:04:43.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Pedro!Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.54,0:04:53.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Hold on tight to the ship!Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.42,0:04:58.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Splash!Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.02,0:05:09.78,Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?! What happened?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.07,0:05:19.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, can you hear me?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.02,0:05:22.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Somebody! Say something!Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.37,0:05:26.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.78,0:05:33.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Is this Heaven? It's beautiful...Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.37,0:01:49.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Is this Heaven? It's beautiful...Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.02,0:05:36.34,Main,,0,0,0,,This is a good ship!Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.36,0:05:42.34,Main,,0,0,0,,The Green Room is found within surging waves. It is a room of waves that forms for a brief moment.Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.34,0:05:47.96,Main,,0,0,0,,It has always been the perfect playground for Fishman children!Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.96,0:05:50.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, this place is...Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.76,0:05:54.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Inside the wave?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.30,0:05:58.01,Main,,0,0,0,,We're gonna sail through it! Hang on!Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.12,0:06:15.83,Main,,0,0,0,,We have a good ship... and a good navigator!Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.83,0:06:20.68,Main,,0,0,0,,With a good helmsman... this ship will be invincible!Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.68,0:06:26.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Amazing!  He's controlling a sloop like it's part of his own body!Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.50,0:06:29.65,Main,,0,0,0,,I've never seen such a helmsman before!Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.65,0:06:32.97,Main,,0,0,0,,You're amazing, Jinbe!Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.97,0:06:35.93,Main,,0,0,0,,So we're not gonna die?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.33,0:06:50.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Wedding...Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.46,0:06:58.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh well... It serves you weaklings right!Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.02,0:07:00.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Lick!Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.00,0:07:03.80,Main,,0,0,0,,This is Perospero.Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.80,0:07:05.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Katakuri.Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.30,0:07:08.52,Main,,0,0,0,,We took care of all of them!Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.52,0:07:09.92,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.92,0:07:12.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami! Brook! Carrot!Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.93,0:07:14.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh dear!Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.51,0:07:17.89,Main,,0,0,0,,We were just about to invade the ship!Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.89,0:07:19.93,Main,,0,0,0,,The plan's canceled, guys!Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.93,0:07:24.45,Main,,0,0,0,,It seems like the ship has already sunk into the sea.Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.46,0:07:27.40,Main,,0,0,0,,But it's strange, Big Sis.Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.40,0:07:30.96,Main,,0,0,0,,The other side of the mirror doesn't look like it's underwater.Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.21,0:07:33.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Look!Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.31,0:07:35.62,Main,,0,0,0,,No way!Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.62,0:07:40.59,Main,,0,0,0,,But, just to make sure, shoot one more time.Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.84,0:07:47.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Wow! The mirror! Big Sis, it suddenly broke!Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.83,0:07:50.77,Main,,0,0,0,,What? What? What's going on?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.29,0:08:00.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami-san! Why did you break the mirror?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.87,0:08:04.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy-san can't come back to the ship without it!Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.17,0:08:09.91,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Let me focus just on this guy!Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.89,0:08:16.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Just break them all! Every single mirror on this ship!Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.06,0:08:18.04,Main,,0,0,0,,But...Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.04,0:08:20.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you want to get in Luffy's way?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.52,0:08:26.99,Main,,0,0,0,,These are our captain's orders! Hurry up!Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.68,0:08:30.59,Main,,0,0,0,,There are still some mirrors!Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.77,0:08:34.46,Main,,0,0,0,,I found one, Joscar!Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.87,0:08:37.22,Main,,0,0,0,,I found it, too, Mascar!Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.77,0:08:42.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's do it, Joscar!Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.63,0:08:44.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's do it, Mascar!Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.36,0:08:47.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Make sure to find all the mirrors!Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.23,0:08:55.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Shoot!Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.17,0:09:12.88,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.88,0:09:14.89,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.32,0:09:20.84,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the last one!Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.90,0:09:26.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Are those guys alive?Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.26,0:09:29.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Bro Peros said they took care of them...Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.75,0:09:33.51,Main,,0,0,0,,I guess the ship sank and the mirrors were shattered by the water pressure, Joscar!Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.51,0:09:36.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess that's it, Mascar!Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.70,0:09:39.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Something seems off about this...Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.19,0:09:43.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.43,0:09:46.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.72,0:09:47.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Chopper!Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.24,0:09:53.70,Main,,0,0,0,,I have something to tell you, so get away from the enemies!Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.70,0:09:54.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.34,0:09:58.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you guys all right?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.20,0:10:02.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Straw Hat is running away!Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.52,0:10:11.74,Main,,0,0,0,,What happened?! The candy guy said the Sunny sank!Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.74,0:10:16.53,Main,,0,0,0,,We thought we were going to sink, too! But Jinbe did something amazing!Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.83,0:10:23.97,Main,,0,0,0,,We're all fine, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.76,0:10:28.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy-san! We broke all the mirrors on the ship!Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.22,0:10:30.18,Main,,0,0,0,,I see! Good job!Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.18,0:10:34.74,Main,,0,0,0,,With this, our enemies won't be able to come here, but you won't be able to come back either!Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.74,0:10:38.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's okay! I'll figure something...Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.44,0:10:41.57,Main,,0,0,0,,No you won't! You don't even have a plan!Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.57,0:10:43.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen carefully, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.65,0:10:51.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji-kun is baking the cake on Cacao Island right now!Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.51,0:10:54.94,Main,,0,0,0,,That's where we're heading!Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.95,0:10:58.04,Main,,0,0,0,,At the earliest, we'll arrive in 10 hours!Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.04,0:11:00.41,Main,,0,0,0,,At around 1 A.M!Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.41,0:11:03.75,Main,,0,0,0,,So after you beat that guy up...Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.75,0:11:08.38,Main,,0,0,0,,search for a mirror that leads to Cacao Island! We'll meet you there!Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.72,0:11:15.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn! I can't get it off!Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.24,0:11:22.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong, Luffy?Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.08,0:11:23.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me?Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.68,0:11:41.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.75,0:11:42.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.96,0:11:44.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Stay focused!Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.19,0:12:19.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Maybe he's in trouble!Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.20,0:12:20.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Please respond!Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.33,0:12:21.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.29,0:12:25.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Luffy?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.37,0:12:26.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy-san!Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.07,0:12:56.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Willow Mochi!Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.62,0:13:37.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy?Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.21,0:13:39.39,Main,,0,0,0,,You're fine, right, Luffy-san?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.78,0:13:42.62,Main,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Luffy?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.81,0:14:26.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and get there, guys!Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.12,0:14:31.87,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll probably be there soon... and I'll be tired of waiting!Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.72,0:14:35.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.54,0:14:37.87,Main,,0,0,0,,See you later, guys!Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.87,0:14:39.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.55,0:14:44.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Our pursuers will be here soon! Let's keep an eye out!Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.23,0:14:45.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Roger!Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.39,0:14:48.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go to the observation deck, Carrot!Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.14,0:14:50.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, Chobro!Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.94,0:15:22.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Next, you'll say...Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.71,0:15:24.63,Main,,0,0,0,,"I don't plan on dying in a place like this."Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.07,0:15:29.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Are those really your last words?Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.83,0:15:56.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't plan on dying in a place like this!Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.56,0:16:01.50,Main,,0,0,0,,No one dies because they want to.Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.59,0:16:03.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Most people...Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.52,0:16:06.12,Main,,0,0,0,,die against their will.Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.81,0:16:12.14,Main,,0,0,0,,He's right!Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.14,0:16:14.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Why don't you drop dead already, Straw Hat?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.62,0:16:16.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Branch!Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.44,0:16:18.37,Main,,0,0,0,,The name's Brûlée!Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.37,0:16:21.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't think that you can beat him with just your spirit, brat!Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.46,0:16:26.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Brother Katakuri isn't just an undefeated man!Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.87,0:16:33.52,Main,,0,0,0,,He's a superhuman whose back has never once touched the ground since he was born!Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.52,0:16:35.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Brûlée!Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.85,0:16:39.39,Main,,0,0,0,,The legend goes like this: The moment he was born, he stood up on his feet...Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.39,0:16:43.09,Main,,0,0,0,,and sat on a chair to sleep on it.Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.09,0:16:49.06,Main,,0,0,0,,He's never laid down in his life! He's a man who scorns even the ground!Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.24,0:16:51.91,Main,,0,0,0,,He's always dignified...Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.91,0:16:54.19,Main,,0,0,0,,calm, and strong!Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.19,0:16:56.70,Main,,0,0,0,,He's the perfect human!Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.44,0:17:02.26,Main,,0,0,0,,That's our Big Brother, Katakuri!Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.22,0:17:05.73,Main,,0,0,0,,He's the Charlotte Family's greatest creation!Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.73,0:17:09.08,Main,,0,0,0,,So a small fry like you challenging him to a duel...Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.08,0:17:12.30,Main,,0,0,0,,is just absurd!Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.30,0:17:14.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Go away!Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.05,0:17:25.13,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to do... to my little sister?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.67,0:17:28.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Brother!Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.84,0:17:50.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Mochi Thrust!Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.18,0:18:02.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Ouch...Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.00,0:18:08.73,Main,,0,0,0,,That was close!Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.81,0:18:24.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I almost got crushed!Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.32,0:18:33.18,Main,,0,0,0,,The name of this spear is Mole!Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.16,0:18:42.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Your arms... or your legs? Which body part do you want removed first?Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.75,0:18:45.57,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll sever them for you!Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.75,0:18:52.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Please start with his head, Big Bro!Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.65,0:18:54.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you fool!Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.65,0:19:12.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber-Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.95,0:19:15.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Giant Rifle!Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.83,0:19:31.69,Main,,0,0,0,,I was listening!Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.69,0:19:33.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.34,0:19:37.41,Main,,0,0,0,,I know about your meeting place.Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.37,0:19:42.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you wanna play with a wave again, Mama?Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.52,0:19:47.53,Captions,,0,1020,315,,At Sea - Within the TerritoryDialogue: 0,0:19:42.57,0:19:45.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Come on! Let's do it!Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.12,0:19:47.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama, are you listening?Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.12,0:19:52.12,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Their ship hasn't sunk yet?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.12,0:19:53.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you sure, Brûlée?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.75,0:19:56.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, I heard their voices!Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.52,0:20:01.72,Main,,0,0,0,,But my candy monster swallowed them with a giant wave!Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.72,0:20:04.24,Main,,0,0,0,,How did they escape?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.95,0:20:09.34,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know how they did it!Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.34,0:20:15.50,Main,,0,0,0,,But they're definitely still alive! They'll be showing up on Cacao Island sometime tonight.Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.51,0:20:20.22,Main,,0,0,0,,That is what they promised Straw Hat Luffy. There's no mistake!Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.22,0:20:22.35,Main,,0,0,0,,What they don't know is...Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.36,0:20:26.03,Main,,0,0,0,,that it's our final destination, too!Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.16,0:20:32.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama! The cake you desire is at Chocolat Town on Cacao Island!Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.38,0:20:34.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Aren't you excited?Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.80,0:20:37.77,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I lied to her out of desperation,Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.06,0:20:43.37,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,but if I take Mama there like this, I can cover up my lie!Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.37,0:20:48.22,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Pudding is baking the cake on Cacao Island!Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.89,0:20:53.37,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens, everything will be settled!Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.85,0:21:07.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Wedding cake!Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.56,0:21:10.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama, it's that way, huh?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.20,0:21:18.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec! That's Nuts Island!Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.01,0:21:21.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, what are you doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.51,0:21:26.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama! Their ship didn't go that way! The cake is on Cacao Island!Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.86,0:21:28.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Wedding...Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.54,0:21:31.42,Main,,0,0,0,,No, Mama! Stop!Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.54,0:21:31.42,Secondary,,0,0,0,,cake!Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.42,0:21:34.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't go that way!Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.85,0:21:36.86,Captions,,1020,0,350,,Mirro-worldDialogue: 0,0:21:40.33,0:21:41.98,Main,,0,0,0,,He never learns!Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.04,0:21:45.07,Main,,0,0,0,,You bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.07,0:21:52.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber-Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.41,0:21:57.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Grizzly Corkscrew Magnum!Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.07,0:22:52.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn!Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.14,0:22:55.52,Main,,0,0,0,,He's always able to hit me when I dodge!Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.71,0:22:58.54,Main,,0,0,0,,That tires me out even more!Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.39,0:23:02.75,Main,,0,0,0,,It's the same for me.Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.04,0:23:07.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Nobody has ever dodged my attacks like you have.Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.02,0:23:09.21,Main,,0,0,0,,It's stressful!Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.74,0:23:28.27,Main,,0,0,0,,You tried to take Mole away from me...Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.08,0:23:32.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn! I almost got it!Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.57,0:23:35.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Flowing Mochi!Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.43,0:23:53.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-What the?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.32,0:23:57.27,Main,,0,0,0,,The ground became mochi!Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.66,0:24:06.36,Main,,0,0,0,,This is just like what Doflamingo did!Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.08,0:24:10.41,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Listen up, fledgling!Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.67,0:24:20.51,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Devil Fruit abilities have yet another stage to them, called "Awakening"!Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.41,0:24:24.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course my ability is awakened.Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.76,0:24:31.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.96,0:24:33.73,Main,,0,0,0,,It's no use.Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.73,0:24:37.01,Main,,0,0,0,,With your elasticity and viscosity , you can't move anymore.Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.32,0:24:43.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Should I just chop you up?Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.00,0:24:47.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Or should I let you suffocate in the mochi?Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.32,0:24:49.56,Main,,0,0,0,,How would you like to die?Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.56,0:24:51.84,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna die!Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.98,0:24:56.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Gear Fourth?Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.00,0:24:59.71,Main,,0,0,0,,How interesting.Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.57,0:25:06.59,Captions,,0,0,0,,Whole Cake Island - Sweet CityDialogue: 0,0:25:11.10,0:25:12.43,Main,,0,0,0,,How odd...Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.68,0:25:18.82,Main,,0,0,0,,We haven't gotten a report on the location of the Straw Hats' ship.Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.82,0:25:21.64,Main,,0,0,0,,What are the Territorial Sea Slugs doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.28,0:25:25.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up, Pekoms!Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.06,0:25:27.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Just stop crying already!Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.58,0:25:31.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Bro Pedro!Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.46,0:25:35.07,Main,,0,0,0,,I feel pity for him...Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.07,0:25:37.00,Main,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe that your childhood friend...Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.00,0:25:40.75,Main,,0,0,0,,and big brother chose to die by suicide bombing-bon...Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.75,0:25:42.00,Main,,0,0,0,,He was our enemy!Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.46,0:25:43.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Bon...Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.13,0:25:49.60,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,It's pointless to die here! The dawn of the world is coming!Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.10,0:25:52.01,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I must go back to my country!Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.06,0:25:57.43,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,This will break all of your-gara magic spells, right?Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.31,0:25:59.35,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Bombs?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.40,0:26:01.52,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Farewell.Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.08,0:26:13.53,Main,,0,0,0,,It was a shock to me as well-amour...Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.04,0:26:23.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Five years ago, I witnessed Pedro begging for his life, tears and all-bon.Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.41,0:26:29.37,Main,,0,0,0,,And that same man sacrificed his life to allow them to sail away!Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.37,0:26:30.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Who cares?Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.43,0:26:36.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Bro...Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.85,0:26:43.77,Main,,0,0,0,,We may still be underestimating Straw Hat Luffy-issant!Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.77,0:26:45.26,Main,,0,0,0,,What's your point?Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.26,0:26:48.51,Main,,0,0,0,,My point is that we should take this more seriously-bon!Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.51,0:26:51.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama will never be taken out by a brat like him!Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.46,0:26:55.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you saying that Straw Hat Luffy is that much weaker than her?Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.04,0:26:58.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course! She's in a different class as a pirate!Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.29,0:27:03.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Can you say the same even while looking at Mama's fallen castle?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.75,0:27:05.75,Main,,0,0,0,,That happened by chance!Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.75,0:27:12.35,Main,,0,0,0,,An accident you say?! And are the Sea Slugs neglecting their security duties by chance as well?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.42,0:27:18.08,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Are you telling me that all of this is part of their plan as well?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.08,0:27:19.90,Main,,0,0,0,,At the very least,Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.90,0:27:24.73,Main,,0,0,0,,since the Straw Hats arrived, unexpected incidents have occurred one after the other-jour!Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.52,0:27:32.41,Main,,0,0,0,,An arrogant ruler will have the rug pulled out from under them.Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.41,0:27:35.74,Main,,0,0,0,,To prevent the one in a million chance that Mama's name is tarnished...Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.74,0:27:41.88,Main,,0,0,0,,A powerful fleet should be sent to the border of our territory as the final line of defence-amour!Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.67,0:27:53.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Ring, ring, ring... ring, ring, ring... Clank.Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.11,0:27:56.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Mont d'Or-sama.Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.30,0:27:57.06,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.06,0:27:59.69,Main,,0,0,0,,There's a call from Custard-sama on the Transponder Snail.Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.69,0:28:02.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Custard was chasing after Bege, wasn't she?Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.65,0:28:07.62,Main,,0,0,0,,This is Mont d'Or. Did you take care of Bege?Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.62,0:28:08.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Well...Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.78,0:28:13.68,Main,,0,0,0,,We lost track of his ship.Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.68,0:28:14.87,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.87,0:28:18.84,Main,,0,0,0,,The Territorial Sea Slugs aren't sending us the location of the ship!Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.84,0:28:21.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?! It's not just us?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.00,0:28:21.52,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.52,0:28:25.76,Main,,0,0,0,,We haven't gotten the location of the Straw Hats, either!Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.76,0:28:27.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.09,0:28:32.97,Main,,0,0,0,,In any case, look for Bege! Listen! Don't let him get away, no matter what!Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.97,0:28:33.93,Main,,0,0,0,,I understand!Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.93,0:28:34.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Clank.Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.33,0:28:37.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Check on them right away!Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.75,0:28:38.44,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.44,0:28:42.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you to check up on the Territorial Sea Slugs on the sea floor!Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.38,0:28:43.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.03,0:28:46.57,Main,,0,0,0,,What the hell is happening down there?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.82,0:28:51.50,Captions,,0,0,0,,At Sea - The Nostra CastelloDialogue: 0,0:28:46.82,0:28:51.50,Note,,0,0,0,,Nostra Castello: "Our Castle" in Italian.Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.50,0:28:54.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I was expecting more of them to chase us!Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.96,0:28:56.72,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on?Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.72,0:29:00.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Maybe they're not tracking our location-rero.Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.77,0:29:02.42,Main,,0,0,0,,The Territorial Sea Slugs?Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.42,0:29:03.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Rero.Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.81,0:29:08.86,Main,,0,0,0,,If there are Territorial Sea Slugs, then the Transponder Snails should react.Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.86,0:29:10.89,Main,,0,0,0,,But they're silent-rero.Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.89,0:29:14.87,Main,,0,0,0,,I've never heard of anything like this!Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.20,0:29:19.11,Main,,0,0,0,,But that's great. Keep it at maximum speed!Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.87,0:29:22.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry to Cacao Island!Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.28,0:29:26.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's take the shortest route to pick up Chiffon!Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.36,0:29:30.28,Main,,0,0,0,,-Yeah! -Rero!Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.13,0:29:55.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Clank.Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.47,0:29:58.46,Main,,0,0,0,,This is Nusstorte, speaking from Germa's ship.Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.47,0:29:58.46,Note,,0,0,0,,Nusstorte: "Engadner Nusstorte", a Swiss nut tart.Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.46,0:30:01.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Brother! How did things go with Germa?!Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.07,0:30:06.94,Main,,0,0,0,,We crushed them with ten thousand soldiers. Their kingdom has been devastated!Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.94,0:30:07.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh!Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.84,0:30:11.29,Main,,0,0,0,,As expected! But you shouldn't go overboard like that...Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.29,0:30:16.26,Main,,0,0,0,,With our strength, it was a piece of cake...Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.24,0:30:18.24,Main,,0,0,0,,By the way, Big Brother...Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.10,0:30:24.74,Captions,,0,910,410,,Germa KingdomDialogue: 0,0:30:20.21,0:30:24.74,Main,,0,0,0,,You didn't destroy their cloning system, did you?Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.42,0:30:29.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course not. That's what we came here for.Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.29,0:30:33.25,Main,,0,0,0,,But other than that, the place has been completely destroyed.Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.47,0:30:36.29,Main,,0,0,0,,That's the least we could do!Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.29,0:30:40.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn Germa! They were doomed the moment we had them in our sights!Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.63,0:30:43.27,Main,,0,0,0,,What happened to the Straw Hats?Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.02,0:30:47.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Actually, we accidentally let them get away.Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.55,0:30:50.17,Main,,0,0,0,,They're heading due west...Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.03,0:30:53.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, it's only a matter of time before we get them.Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.81,0:30:56.49,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll leave it to you!Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.49,0:30:59.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, good job!Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.08,0:31:00.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Clank.Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.62,0:31:03.49,Main,,0,0,0,,And that's how you do it...Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.17,0:31:07.15,Main,,0,0,0,,So Luffy-kun and the others are okay.Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.15,0:31:10.30,Main,,0,0,0,,What should we do now?Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.93,0:31:16.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go! Set sail!Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.97,0:31:18.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Roger!Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.67,0:31:21.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Muscle Balloon!Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.02,0:31:44.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Why should I stand here and watch...Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.03,0:31:46.57,Main,,0,0,0,,when I already know that you're going to power up?Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.99,0:31:59.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Straw Hat Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.47,0:32:02.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you this now...Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.58,0:32:05.57,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not underestimating you!Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.65,0:32:18.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Mirror Mochi!Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.94,0:32:21.51,Main,,0,0,0,,What? That's mochi?!Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.51,0:32:24.98,Main,,0,0,0,,This is bad! If I get crushed under all that mochi, I'll be buried alive!Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.98,0:32:27.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, you'll suffocate.Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.15,0:32:29.61,Main,,0,0,0,,This is where you die!Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.56,0:32:53.40,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry that the fight has to end like this... but it's made me a little irritated.Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.40,0:32:56.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Because you held on for much longer than expected...Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.03,0:32:59.36,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm 40 minutes late for today's merienda.Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.03,0:32:59.36,Note,,0,0,0,,Merienda: Spanish word for a light meal.Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.91,0:33:05.29,Main,,0,0,0,,The suffering won't last long...Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.49,0:33:10.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Farewell, Straw Hat...Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.84,0:33:25.90,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Feeso, Galaxy 9000  Timing: Galaxy 9000  Quality Assurance: Feeso, Galaxy 9000, Grug, Pepperjack  Soundtracking:  Halee  Graphics:  Datenshi  Karaoke: KaitouYahiko  Translation: CrunchyrollDialogue: 0,0:00:06.12,0:00:06.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.12,0:00:06.52,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.72,0:00:06.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,YDialogue: 0,0:00:05.74,0:00:06.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 0,0:00:05.76,0:00:06.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 0,0:00:05.78,0:00:06.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,!Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.22,0:00:07.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Yes!Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.80,0:00:06.79,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,WDialogue: 0,0:00:05.82,0:00:06.79,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 0,0:00:05.84,0:00:06.79,Ka